1
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,680
(Howard:)Oh, come on, that can't be true.

2
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:10,840
(Raj:)I did the research. Tony the Tiger...

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,640
...Dig 'Em the frog, Cap'N Crunch, Toucan
Sam, Count Chocula, Trix the Rabbit...

4
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,680
(Raj:)...Snap, Crackle and Pop.

5
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:21,010
(Raj:)Not one cereal mascot is a girl.

6
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:25,480
(Raj:)It's a total breakfast sausage fest.

7
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:27,850
(Leonard:)Are we done with this?

8
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:32,730
(Raj:)Almost. Franken Berry, Boo Berry,
Sugar Bear, and the Honey Nut Cheerio Bee.

9
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,050
(Raj:)I believe his name is Buzz.

10
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:38,760
(Leonard:)Terrific. Something weird happened
and I don't know what to do about it.

11
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:40,850
- What's going on?
- Sheldon's assistant...

12
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,080
(Leonard:)...asked me on a date.

13
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:43,930
(Raj:)How could you do that to me?

14
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:46,560
(Raj:)You know I've been working it
with Alex for weeks.

15
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:49,200
(Leonard:)Working it? You can't even talk to her.

16
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:51,890
(Raj:)I talk with my eyes.

17
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:02,020
(Howard:)You look like my little cousin when
he's dropping one in his diaper.

